    {
      "id": 1527,
      "category": "researcher",
      "content": "Insufficient imageid filtration in image editor allowed an attacker to read arbitrary files. An attacker could read files by setting file path in imageid GET param in /edit/process API endpoint - http://imgur.com/edit/process?imageid=../../../../../../../../../../etc/passwd",
